  "email_html_body": "\n    <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n      <h1 style=\"color: #007bff; text-align:center; font-size: 24px;\">GitHub 開源科技報告</h1>\n      <p style=\"text-align:center; color:#666; margin-bottom: 30px;\">日期: 2026-08-15</p>\n    \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">辦公室應用</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">FreeDomain</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Markdown | Star: 193,315</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個專案提供免費的網域名稱註冊服務以及實用的DNS學習資源，旨在降低網站架設的門檻並普及網路知識。對於需要建立線上存在或學習網路基礎知識的個人和小型企業來說，這是一個非常有價值的資源。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/DigitalPlatDev/FreeDomain\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/辦公室應用/FreeDomain\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">寫程式</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">linux</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: C | Star: 242,939</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是Linux作業系統的核心原始碼樹，是現代運算基礎設施的基石。作為一個開源專案，它推動了伺服器、嵌入式系統及桌面環境的廣泛發展，對於全球軟體開發社群具備無可取代的地位。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/linux\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">skills</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 218,327</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是由一位工程師分享的實用技能集合，可能包含一系列的腳本或工具，旨在提升開發者的日常工作效率。雖然名稱提到「.agents」，但從語言和描述來看，它更像是工程師的生產力工具集合，屬於「寫程式」範疇。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/mattpocock/skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">ohmyzsh</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 189,213</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個廣受歡迎且由社群驅動的Zsh設定管理框架，提供豐富的外掛和主題，顯著提升終端機的使用體驗。它簡化了開發者的工作流程，透過強大的自訂功能和工具整合，大幅提高命令列操作的效率和樂趣。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ohmyzsh/ohmyzsh\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/ohmyzsh\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">eve-software-factory-template</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 778</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個名為Foreman的Eve軟體工廠模板，旨在為開發者提供快速啟動軟體專案的基礎架構。作為一個軟體開發模板，它能幫助團隊標準化開發流程並加速專案初始化。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/vercel-labs/eve-software-factory-template\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/eve-software-factory-template\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Skill</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">tensorflow</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: C++ | Star: 197,045</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是Google開源的機器學習框架，提供一套全面的工具和函式庫，讓研究人員和開發者能輕鬆建立和部署各種機器學習模型。作為業界最廣泛使用的框架之一，它對於推動AI研究、教育及應用普及功不可沒。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/tensorflow\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">watermarks-remover</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 9,664</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個工具旨在移除多供應商的AI溯源標記，處理圖像、文件等多種格式中的Unicode文本衛生、統計重寫鉤子及C2PA元數據。對於需要處理AI生成內容的隱私、版權或數據清理任務的用戶來說，它提供了一個關鍵的解決方案。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/guillaumemeyer/watermarks-remover\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/watermarks-remover\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">chatbot-template</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 690</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個基於Next.js和AI SDK構建的極簡聊天機器人模板，並運行於Vercel AI Gateway。它為開發者提供了一個快速啟動和部署聊天機器人應用的基礎，簡化了AI對話介面的開發流程。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/shadcn-ui/chatbot-template\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/chatbot-template\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Agent</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">openclaw</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 386,397</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個跨平台個人AI助理，旨在為用戶提供自主性的AI互動體驗，無論何種作業系統或平台都能使用。它值得關注，因為它將個人AI助理的可用性推向廣泛的設備和環境。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">ECC</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: JavaScript | Star: 240,288</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個專為AI代理設計的效能優化系統，整合了技能、直覺、記憶和安全功能，旨在提升Claude Code、Codex等大型語言模型編程代理的效率與安全性。對於開發和部署高性能AI編程代理的開發者而言，它提供了一套重要的優化工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/ECC\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">hermes-agent</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 231,055</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個具備成長能力的AI代理，旨在透過與用戶的互動來學習和適應，提供個人化的協助。其「與你一同成長」的理念，使其成為探索更智慧、更個人化AI體驗的潛力專案。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/hermes-agent\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">opencode</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 197,781</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個開源的程式碼編寫AI代理，旨在自動化或協助開發者完成程式碼撰寫任務。作為一個開源的AI編碼工具，它為社群提供了一個可共同協作和改進的基礎，對於提升開發效率和探索AI輔助編程的潛力具有重要意義。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/opencode\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">claw-code</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Rust | Star: 195,052</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個完全由AI代理管理和維護的博物館展覽專案，以Rust語言結合Gajae-Code/LazyCodex技術開發。其核心概念是實現「無人工干預」的自主運作，展示了AI代理在複雜系統管理和內容生成方面的先進能力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ultraworkers/claw-code\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/claw-code\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">deepseek-harness-desktop</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 5,759</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是為DeepSeek Harness (DSH)生態系統打造的現代化桌面應用程式，旨在提供更流暢、更整合的用戶體驗。它使得用戶能夠更便利地管理和操作DSH代理，對於提升AI代理的可用性和普及性具有重要意義。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/anywhere-labs/deepseek-harness-desktop\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/deepseek-harness-desktop\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-dsh-plugin</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 2,968</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個精心策劃的DeepSeek Harness (DSH)外掛精選列表，為DSH用戶提供豐富的功能擴展選擇。它有助於用戶發掘和利用DSH生態系統的潛力，豐富AI代理的應用場景和客製化能力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/awesome-dsh-plugin\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">dsh-web-ui</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 2,691</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個專案為DeepSeek Harness (DSH)的網頁介面提供了豐富的外掛和皮膚，包含任務看板、Git圖形、遠端行動介面等多項功能。它旨在提升DSH用戶的操作體驗和客製化程度，讓AI代理的管理更加直觀和高效。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web-ui\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/dsh-web-ui\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">dsh-anchored-standard</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: JavaScript | Star: 2,157</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是為DeepSeek Harness (DSH)設計的兩階段預設配置，先進行最小化對齊啟動，再導入完整的標準工具集。它為DSH用戶提供了一個優化的起步點和標準工具環境，旨在簡化DSH代理的部署和使用流程。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/dsh-anchored-standard\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">dsh-routing-suite</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: PowerShell | Star: 1,644</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個dsh-routing-suite包含運行時注入器和任務感知推理模式路由器預設，旨在優化DeepSeek Harness (DSH)代理的路由和決策能力。它透過智能的任務分派和推理模式，提升DSH代理在複雜任務中的表現和效率。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/yjh051108/dsh-routing-suite\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/dsh-routing-suite\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">dsh-TUI</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 1,254</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是為DeepSeek Harness (DSH)設計的終端文字使用者介面(TUI)外掛，提供Claude Code風格的全螢幕互動體驗。它為偏好命令列操作的開發者提供了一個高效且視覺化的DSH代理管理工具，補足了官方在TUI方面的空白。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ccch1mneyyy/dsh-TUI\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/dsh-TUI\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">deepseek-harness-orange-book</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: HTML | Star: 758</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這本DeepSeek Harness橙皮書提供了完整的系統提示詞、啟動清單和原始會話日誌，揭示了官方文件中未公開的實測細節。它對於深入理解DeepSeek Harness的工作原理和高效部署AI代理，提供了極具價值的實用指南。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/alchaincyf/deepseek-harness-orange-book\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/deepseek-harness-orange-book\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            </div>"
